        "content": "## Notion Workflow\n\n**Purpose**: n8n workflow: Notion Workflow. 4 nodes wired together. Uses: notion, dropcontact, calendlyTrigger, stopAndError. Sourced from czlonkowski/Zie619 n8n-workflows community archive (workflows/Calendly/0125_Calendly_Notion_Automate_Triggered.json). Configure credentials and any hardcoded IDs before activating.\n\n**Services needed**: notion, dropcontact, calendlyTrigger, stopAndError\n\n**Difficulty**: auto-deploy\n\n**Setup**:\n1. Configure credentials for the services above\n2. Update any hardcoded IDs / URLs\n3. Test with sample data before activating\n\n_Source: https://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows_\n_Curated by ai-ops-architect on 2026-05-05_",
